ifecycle and state changes and routes matching events to notification or automation targets." style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#102A43;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8CB7E8;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="696.3333333333334" width="612" height="77.16666666666667" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="network-v-66" value="OCI Alarms&amp;#xa;Evaluates metric streams against MQL thresholds and emits stateful, severity-aware operational alarm messages." style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#102A43;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8CB7E8;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="780.5" width="612" height="77.16666666666667" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="network-v-67" value="OCI Notifications&amp;#xa;Publishes messages through topics and subscriptions to people, HTTPS endpoints, functions, and supported delivery channels." style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#102A43;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8CB7E8;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="864.6666666666667" width="612" height="77.16666666666667" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="network-v-68" value="OCI Announcements&amp;#xa;Provides tenancy-scoped information about service events, planned maintenance, advisories, and operational notices." style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#102A43;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8CB7E8;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="948.8333333333334" width="612" height="77.16666666666667" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="network-v-69" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=42;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=14;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#182230;fillColor=#EEF6FF;strokeColor=#8CB7E8;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="1044" width="640" height="552" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="network-v-70" value="B. ADVANCED ANALYTICS" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;fontSize=17;fontColor=#145CA8;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="1052" width="612" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="network-v-71" value="OCI Logging Analytics&amp;#xa;Indexes and enriches logs for interactive search, clustering, link analysis, anomaly detection, and root-cause investigation." style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#102A43;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8CB7E8;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="1092" width="612" height="77.16666666666667" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="network-v-72" value="OCI Application Performance Monitoring&amp;#xa;Correlates distributed traces, application topology, synthetic monitoring, and real-user experience for service transactions." style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#102A43;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8CB7E8;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="894" y="1176.1666666666667" width="612" height="77.16666666666667" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="network-v-73" value="OCI Stack Monitoring&amp;#xa;Discovers and monitors application-stack resources, their health, performance, and topology relationships across infrastructure layers." style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpa